      "value": "<p>When the trap is activated, each creature within range takes 1 piercing damage and must succeed on a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a creature is poisoned for 1 minute. The creature can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns. On a success, the poisoned condition fades.</p>",
